{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e595bfa4-1926-8c3b-abd6-b261bb7a432f",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T09:05:56-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luis Valdez",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:01:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:01:13-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, Kevin. Yes, good morning. My name is Luis Valdez. I am calling about the water, the drain, on my street. I am on speaker, I hope you hear me okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:01:26-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you fine, Mr. Valdez. Go ahead. Where's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:01:31-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three-forty Broadway, in the North End. The water comes down the hill from the next street, and it goes straight into the yard. Straight in. Every time it rains hard, the same."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:01:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, three-forty Broadway. And this is from the storm this past weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:01:51-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. Yesterday it was finished, the storm, but the water is still there this morning. And the drain, it does not take it. It is full. Nothing goes down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:02:06-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. So the drain's not taking water and it's running off the hill into your yard. Let me write that down. Is the water getting into the house at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:02:19-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, not in the house. The yard only, and the sidewalk. But the cars, they are slowing to a crawl through it. Very slow, because the water is across the road. Somebody is going to hit somebody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:02:35-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's not great on Broadway, it's a busy road. Is it the whole width or just by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:02:44-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Most of the one side. By the curb and more. The cars go to the middle to avoid it, so then the other cars, they wait. You understand what I say? The cars from both directions, they are in the same place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:03:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I follow you. Cars swinging out around the water and meeting in the middle. I'll note it as a traffic hazard too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:03:12-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And this is not the first time, you know. Many storms, same thing. I am a renter, so I cannot fix the drain, it is the city drain, yes? Not the landlord?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:03:27-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it's the one in the street or at the curb, that's ours, yeah. If it's a drain inside the yard, that'd be a different story. Which one is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:03:40-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The one in the street, by the curb. Full of leaves and, uh, sand, and I think maybe the plow put the snow there before. So it is closed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:03:53-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that makes sense. Sand and debris from the storm, plus plow piles. I'll send it over to the crew that does catch basins. They've got a lot on the list after a storm like that, so I can't tell you the hour."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:04:11-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand, but it is Monday already, and nobody came. I am saying this because it is every time. Somebody comes after many days, when the water is gone alone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:04:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. I'll mark it as water standing in the road, so it gets looked at sooner than a routine cleaning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:04:34-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Okay. Sorry, I am watching the clock, because a movie starts in one hour and I need to leave soon. So, can I ask, they will call me back when it is done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:04:49-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I'll put a note to call you once the crew has cleared it. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:04:57-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-nine-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:04:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-nine-four. Got it. And it's Valdez, V-A-L-D-E-Z?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:05:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Luis. L-U-I-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:05:06-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. So to read it back: three-forty Broadway, street drain blocked, water running down from the next street into your yard and across the road, traffic backing up. Call back at that number when it's done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:05:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. You said it better than me. [pause] So, if nobody calls, I can call again, and ask for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:05:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can call again, sure. Just give the address and they'll find the ticket. Kevin's the name, but anybody here can pull it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:05:41-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Kevin. Thank you. I hope they come today, not next week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:05:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll do what I can to get it moving. Enjoy the movie, Mr. Valdez."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T09:05:54-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
